-- 0213_mapping_help_strings.sql
-- Decision 0562. Help written at length: the mapping editor's own help, and
-- the Routes and Route monitor help extended with formats, checks and
-- supplier mappings.
--
-- A screen's help is its key, then any numbered keys after it
-- (help.screen.mapping.2, .3, ...), one line each: a line starting "## " is
-- a heading, one starting "- " a list item, anything else a paragraph. One
-- line per key rather than line breaks in one value, because stored words
-- hold no escape sequences (0546), and a translator works line by line.


